desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "File Disclosure"
	title_zh: "File Disclosure"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-file-disclosure"
	risk: "information-exposure"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Special requests can determine whether a file exists on a filesystem that's outside the Rails app's root directory. To fix this, set config.serve_static_assets = false.

### 风险类型
敏感信息泄露（information-exposure）

### 影响
应用可能暴露内部路径、环境信息或敏感数据，攻击者可借此收集攻击面。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-22: Improper Limitation of a Pathname to a Restricted Directory ('Path Traversal')
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
限制敏感信息的输出范围，关闭不必要的调试接口，并对暴露内容进行脱敏。

推荐修复：
To fix this, set config.serve_static_assets = false.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.rb": <<<POS
config.serve_static_assets = true
POS
	"safefile://pos.rb": <<<NEG
config.serve_static_assets = false
NEG
)

${*.rb}.pattern_regex(/(?:config\.serve_static_assets\s+=\s+true)/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "File Disclosure",
	title_zh: "File Disclosure",
	message: "File Disclosure detected.",
}
